UnitMetaquoter::QuoteExactInput
├── when the path is empty
│   └── it reverts with EP
└── given the path is not empty
    ├── when a pool factory is not approved
    │   └── it reverts with AF
    └── given the pool factory is approved
        ├── when the pool is not a registered target
        │   └── it reverts with IP
        └── given the pool is a registered target
            ├── when tokenIn is not a token of its hop pool
            │   └── it reverts with TI
            └── given tokenIn is a token of its hop pool
                ├── when the route is a single CL pool
                │   ├── it returns the CL quote as amountOut
                │   └── it populates the lists at the pool index
                ├── when the route is a single V2 pool
                │   ├── it returns the getAmountOutWithTotalFee quote as amountOut
                │   └── it leaves the lists zeroed
                ├── when the route mixes CL and V2 pools
                │   ├── it chains each hop output into the next hop input
                │   ├── it populates the lists only at CL indexes
                │   └── it returns the final amountOut
                ├── when a pool reports an unknown pool type
                │   ├── it does not read the factory pause flag
                │   ├── it does not read the pool tokens
                │   └── it reverts with PT
                └── when a V2 hop quotes zero output
                    └── it reverts with IO
